<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/builder"><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: pagesCollection;" data-settings="{&quot;propertyOptions&quot;:&quot;pageCollections&quot;,&quot;sortOptions&quot;:true}"><label for="field-UID">Pages Collection</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="pagesCollection" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>builder-pages</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The collection used for page metadata. Only collections whose schema is <code>builder-page</code>, or inherits from it, are offered — every object in this collection is served as a page.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: assetsPath;"><label for="field-UID">Assets Path</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="assetsPath" placeholder="assets" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="assets" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Public assets directory relative to docroot. Your build tool should output CSS, JS, and other assets here.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: liveReload;"><label for="field-UID">Live Reload Preview</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="liveReload" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Live Reload Preview</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">When you save a Builder template or page, every open admin tab on a Builder page reloads automatically. Only active for logged-in admin sessions; visitors never see it.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>